{"seq":45,"slug":"objective-c-language","title":"Objective-C 语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Objective-C 语言\n\nObjective-C 把 C 语言的全部能力，和一套从 Smalltalk 偷来的动态消息系统焊在了一起。理解这门语言的关键，不在于记住它那对方括号包裹的奇特语法，而在于看清一个事实：当你写下 `[obj doSomething]` 时，你不是在调用一个函数，而是在运行期向对象「发送一条消息」，由对象自己决定如何应答。这条消息可以被转发、被拦截、被记录、被动态合成——整个 Cocoa 框架的灵活性、KVO 的自动通知、界面构建器的连线、乃至今天 Swift 与旧代码的无缝互通，根源都在这套消息机制里。\n\n本 hub 用四条主线层层递进，带你从「看懂语法」走到「驾驭运行期」。\n\n第一条主线是**基础**：先回答「2026 年还学它干什么」，再讲清消息传递这一核心模型，最后落到类与对象的内存布局。这一章是地基，决定了你后面对所有动态行为的直觉是否正确。\n\n第二条主线是**语言核心**：把日常写 Objective-C 真正要用的三组要素讲透——属性与 ARC 自动引用计数如何管理对象生命周期、分类与协议如何在不改源码的前提下扩展和约束类型、Block 闭包与 GCD 如何承载现代并发。掌握这三块，你就能读写绝大多数生产代码。\n\n第三条主线是**运行时**：把第一章埋下的消息机制兑现成可操作的能力。动态运行时讲消息如何被解析与转发，KVC/KVO 讲键值编码与观察这套「魔法」的真实底层，方法交换讲如何在运行期偷梁换柱。这一章是 Objective-C 区别于多数静态语言的灵魂，也是各类调试、埋点、Hook 框架的来源。\n\n第四条主线是**工程实践**：把语言放回真实工程。先讲与 Swift/C 的互操作——这是 2026 年绝大多数 Objective-C 代码的实际生存环境；再讲 Cocoa 沉淀下来的设计模式；最后用一章专门盘点这门「灵活到危险」的语言里那些必须警惕的陷阱与边界。\n\n四条主线不是平行的知识点，而是一条因果链：消息驱动是因，运行期能力是果，工程实践是这套因果在真实约束下的取舍。读完你会明白，Objective-C 的「老」不等于「过时」，它依然是理解整个 Apple 平台运行时行为的最短路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-objective-c","title":"为什么学 Objective-C","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/foundations/why-objective-c"},{"seq":2,"slug":"messaging-runtime","title":"消息传递模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/foundations/messaging-runtime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"classes-objects","title":"类与对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/foundations/classes-objects"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language","title":"语言核心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/language","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"properties-memory","title":"属性与内存管理（ARC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/language/properties-memory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"categories-protocols","title":"分类与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/language/categories-protocols"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blocks-gcd","title":"Block 与 GCD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/language/blocks-gcd"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime","title":"运行时","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/runtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dynamic-runtime","title":"动态运行时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/runtime/dynamic-runtime"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kvc-kvo","title":"KVC 与 KVO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/runtime/kvc-kvo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"method-swizzling","title":"方法交换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/runtime/method-swizzling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interop-swift-c","title":"与 Swift/C 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/practice/interop-swift-c"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cocoa-patterns","title":"Cocoa 设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/practice/cocoa-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/objective-c-language/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}